Subject: [PATCH 4/4] docs: cover both fork changes in the upstream-sync
 procedure

The maintenance section still claimed exactly one capability and its conflict
table had no entry for the Task console work. Describe both change sets, add
the console files to the table, teach the sync script's conflict hints the same
list, and commit patches/ as a replayable snapshot that the script refreshes
after each sync.
